      "id": 243015,
      "name": "",
      "username": "fjur",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/fjur/{size}/4849_2.png",
      "created_at": "2022-03-01T01:23:29.932Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I would recommend getting in contact with the official Wiki editors, to ask how they did things: <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/lynkfox\">@lynkfox</a>, <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/jeysie\">@Jeysie</a>, <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/powerhound_2000\">@Powerhound_2000</a>, and <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/uxm266\">@UXM266</a>.</p>\n<p>Also, just to clarify, are you talking about a wiki for homemade <em>mechanics and rules</em> or a wiki for people’s Heroes, Villains, Environments, etc. made with the official rules?</p>\n<p>I can see the reasons one would want to use a wiki, but if it’s the latter, you might also consider simply making some Forum threads for these things.</p>",
